 more closely. Building and infrastructure projects can thus be conducted more efficiently and sustainably. The unique holding structure provides our 16 strong brands with the flexibility to innovate in an entrepreneurial way while closely engaging with their 5.0 million customers worldwide. Founded by Prof. Georg Nemetschek in 1963, the company today employs more than 2,500 experts.","contact@nemetschek.com",{"@type":1921,"height":1933,"url":1934,"width":1935},"110","https://maxonnet.imgix.net/images/maxon/Nemetschek_Group.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&domain=maxonnet.imgix.net&ixlib=php-3.3.1","458",{"@type":1921,"height":1937,"url":1938,"width":1939},"60","https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/_600x60_fit_center-center_82_none/Nemetschek_Group.png?mtime=1619307560","250","Nemetschek Group","+49 89 540459-0","https://www.nemetschek.com/en/brands/maxon",{"@context":1908,"@id":1915,"@type":1944,"image":1945,"logo":1949,"name":27,"priceRange":1952},"LocalBusiness",{"@type":1921,"height":1946,"url":1947,"width":1948},"1080","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/maxonsites/images/maxon/Maxon_Logo_PR.jpg","1920",{"@type":1921,"height":1937,"url":1950,"width":1951},"https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/_600x60_fit_center-center_82_none/724891/Maxon_Logo_PR.png?mtime=1626963281","107","$",{},"white",{"__typename":1956,"allGlobalCategories":1768,"certifiedPartnersCategories":1628,"departments":1677,"locations":1579,"productTypes":1650,"regions":1734,"sectionSettings":1232},"Query",{"isProgrammaticScroll":499,"globalAutoplayDisabled":499,"globalAutoplayLocalStorageKey":1958,"storedRegion":-1,"region":-1,"regionFound":499,"haveFetchedRegion":499,"selectedSite":1959,"scrollDirection":1960,"lastScrollPos":1961,"navFixed":499,"pagination":1962},"maxon-pause-autoplaying-media","Maxon.net","up",0,{"currentPage":461},{"modalOpened":499},{"userData":9,"isLoggedIn":499,"hasInitialized":499}]</script>
